sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as AI client via ZyroPay
  participant S as Address Intelligence (seller)
  participant K as Token Intelligence (specialist)
  participant L as Cardano preprod
  C->>S: paid GET address report (x402, passkey-approved)
  S->>S: verify the buyer's payment, start the report
  S->>K: GET token report for the address's top token
  K-->>S: 402, 1.5 tADA
  S->>L: pay from the seller's own small budget wallet (cap 3 tADA)
  K-->>S: 200, token report, X-Delivery-Receipt
  S->>S: verify the specialist's receipt against the bytes received
  S-->>C: address report with subcontracted[], embedding the specialist's report, receipt and payment tx
  Note over C,K: The seller's own receipt signs a body that contains the specialist's receipt: a receipt chain
